{"id":"u167","kelas":"kosa","no":20,"judul":"Idiom Menengah 2: Perasaan dan Situasi","title":"Idioms: Feelings and Situations","emoji":"🎭","ringkas":"a blessing in disguise, the last straw, back to square one, out of the blue","ready":true,"goals":["memahami **idiom tentang perasaan dan situasi**","menyebut **keberuntungan, kejutan, dan masalah** dengan idiom","membedakan idiom yang mirip bentuknya","menjawab pertanyaan makna dan pemakaian idiom"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Idiom juga dipakai untuk menggambarkan perasaan dan keadaan. Pelajari ungkapan-ungkapan berikut beserta situasi yang cocok."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Perasaan","items":[{"en":"feel blue","id":"merasa sedih","ex":"I feel blue today."},{"en":"over the moon","id":"sangat gembira","ex":"She was over the moon about the news."},{"en":"under the weather","id":"kurang sehat","ex":"I'm a bit under the weather."},{"en":"on cloud nine","id":"sangat bahagia","ex":"He was on cloud nine after the win."},{"en":"get cold feet","id":"tiba-tiba ragu","ex":"He got cold feet before the speech."},{"en":"have butterflies in your stomach","id":"gugup","ex":"I had butterflies in my stomach."},{"en":"lose your temper","id":"kehilangan kesabaran","ex":"Don't lose your temper."},{"en":"keep your cool","id":"tetap tenang","ex":"She kept her cool during the test."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Situasi","items":[{"en":"a blessing in disguise","id":"berkah tersembunyi","ex":"Losing that job was a blessing in disguise."},{"en":"the last straw","id":"puncak masalah","ex":"His rudeness was the last straw."},{"en":"out of the blue","id":"tiba-tiba","ex":"He called me out of the blue."},{"en":"a piece of cake","id":"sangat mudah","ex":"The test was a piece of cake."},{"en":"in the same boat","id":"senasib","ex":"We are all in the same boat."},{"en":"spill the beans","id":"membocorkan rahasia","ex":"Who spilled the beans?"},{"en":"learn the ropes","id":"belajar dasar-dasar","ex":"She is learning the ropes at her new job."},{"en":"the tip of the iceberg","id":"sebagian kecil dari masalah besar","ex":"This is only the tip of the iceberg."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Tindakan","items":[{"en":"jump the gun","id":"bertindak terlalu cepat","ex":"Don't jump the gun; wait for the results."},{"en":"call the shots","id":"memegang kendali","ex":"Who calls the shots here?"},{"en":"cut corners","id":"mengambil jalan pintas","ex":"They cut corners to save money."},{"en":"play it by ear","id":"melihat situasi nanti","ex":"Let's play it by ear."},{"en":"stick to your guns","id":"berpegang pada pendirian","ex":"He stuck to his guns."},{"en":"sit on the fence","id":"tidak memihak","ex":"Stop sitting on the fence."},{"en":"beat around the bush","id":"bertele-tele","ex":"Don't beat around the bush."},{"en":"miss the boat","id":"kehilangan kesempatan","ex":"I missed the boat on that offer."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Berita mengejutkan","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"I heard that you got the scholarship!","id":"Aku dengar kamu mendapat beasiswa!"},{"who":"Rani","en":"Yes! I'm over the moon. It came out of the blue.","id":"Ya! Aku sangat gembira. Datang tiba-tiba."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Were you nervous at the interview?","id":"Apakah kamu gugup saat wawancara?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"I had butterflies in my stomach, but I kept my cool.","id":"Perutku mulas, tetapi aku tetap tenang."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Cari satu idiom baru per hari dari lagu, film, atau video berbahasa Inggris dan tambahkan ke daftarmu bersama kalimat contohnya."},{"t":"summary","items":["Perasaan: [[feel blue]], [[over the moon]], [[under the weather]], [[on cloud nine]], [[get cold feet]], [[have butterflies in your stomach]].","Situasi: [[a blessing in disguise]], [[the last straw]], [[out of the blue]], [[a piece of cake]], [[in the same boat]], [[spill the beans]].","Tindakan: [[jump the gun]], [[call the shots]], [[cut corners]], [[play it by ear]], [[stick to your guns]], [[sit on the fence]]."]}],"practice":